  "body_markdown": "About us\n\nmeet Dr. ChrisMeet The TeamLivewell DifferenceOffice TourTechnologyJoin Our Team\n\nservices\n\ndCOEFull Mouth ReconstructionSedation Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nSmile MakeoverPorcelain VeneersNo Prep VeneersGum RecontouringTeeth WhiteningDental Bonding\n\nImplant Dentistry\n\nDental ImplantsSingle ImplantsImplant BridgesAll-on-X ImplantsLocator-Retained Dentures\n\nRestorative Dentistry\n\nDental CrownsInlays & OnlaysDental BridgesTooth-Colored Fillings\n\nOral Surgery\n\nBone GraftingRidge AugmentationTooth ExtractionSinus LiftWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nOrthodontics\n\nInvisalignBraces\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPreventive DentistryPreventive CleaningGum TherapyRoot Canal Therapy\n\nTMJ TreatmentDental Emergencies\n\nnew patient\n\nfirst visit & new examInsurance & FinancingBlog\n\nOur work\n\nSmile GalleryTestimonials\n\nContact\n\ncall (703) 690-0102Request An Appointment\n\nBook Now\n\n703-690-0102\n\nLivewell Difference\n\nmeet Dr. Chris\n\nMeet The Team\n\nJoin Our Team\n\nOffice Tour\n\nTechnology\n\nServices\n\nFull Mouth Reconstruction\n\nDCOE\n\nTMJ Treatment\n\nDental Emergencies\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nPreventive\n\nDental Bridges\n\nRoot Canal\n\nProfessional Dental Cleaning\n\nScaling & Root Planing\n\nAll General Dentistry services\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nNo Prep Veneers\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nGum Recontouring\n\nAll Cosmetic Dentistry Services\n\nSingle Implants\n\nImplant Bridges\n\nAll-on-X Implants\n\nLocator-Retained Dentures\n\nAll Implant Dentistry Services\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nTooth Extraction\n\nSinus Lift\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nInvisalign\n\nBraces\n\nAll Orthodontics Services\n\nDental Crowns\n\nTooth-Colored Fillings\n\nDental Bonding\n\nInlays & Onlays\n\nAll Restorative Dentistry Services\n\nNew Patient\n\nfirst visit & new exam\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nBlog\n\nTestimonials\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nCALL US: (703) 690-0102\n\nBOOK AN APPOINTMENT\n\n\n# Livewell Dental: Where Your Smile Inspires\n\n\nA practice built around one patient at a time\n\nCare that runs deeper than the immediate problem\n\nA dentist who stays involved from first visit to final result\n\n\n## We Believe Every Patient Deserves Dentistry Done at the Highest Level\n\n\nWatch Now\n\n\n## We Believe the Work We Do Here Has a Real Impact\n\n\nOur team is here because this work means something to us. Dentistry changes more than teeth. It changes how someone eats, how they speaks, how they smiles, and how they carry themselves again. We see that every day, so every part of the experience matters to us, from the first conversation to the care we provide in the chair.\n\nWe are not trying to cover every specialty or serve every age group. Our focus is adult comprehensive care: restorative, cosmetic, and implant dentistry for people who want a result that lasts. That focus allows us to go deeper on every case rather than wider across every category.\n\n\n## We Believe Consistency Builds the Kind of Trust That Takes Time\n\n\nWhen you come to Livewell, you will always work with Dr. Chris. He plans your treatment, carries it out, and follows up on it. There is no associate you see on alternating visits, no junior provider who handles part of the case while Dr. Chris handles another. Every decision about your care runs through one person who knows your complete history.\n\nThat consistency matters more in dentistry than most patients realize. It means your bite analysis and your crown placement are understood by the same person. It means the notes from your last appointment are not just a file someone else skims before you sit down. It means continuity, and continuity means fewer mistakes.\n\nExperience Dr. Chris' Care\n\n\n### We Believe Advanced Dentistry Should Feel Straightforward\n\n\nDr. Chris trained at UCSF School of Dentistry, completed a residency in Advanced Education in General Dentistry, and continued his postgraduate education at the Kois Center in Seattle. He holds fellowship status with both the Academy of General Dentistry and the International Congress of Oral Implantologists, and he teaches implant dentistry to other clinicians across the country through the Implant Accelerator program.\n\nOver 10 years of experience\n\nUCSF School of Dentistry Graduate\n\nAEGD Residency Completed at UCSF\n\nKois Center Graduate, Seattle WA\n\nFellow, Academy of General Dentistry (FAGD) — Top 6% of US Dentists\n\nFellow, International Congress of Oral Implantologists (FICOI)\n\nClinical Instructor, Implant Accelerator\n\nBook Your First Visit\n\n\n## WE BELIEVE YOUR COMFORT DURING TREATMENT IS NON-NEGOTIABLE, NOT AN AFTERTHOUGHT\n\n\n\n### Preparation\n\n\nWe plan the visit before you arrive so treatment feels organized, predictable, and respectful of what you need to feel comfortable.\n\n\n### Anesthesia\n\n\nDr. Chris cares deeply about this part, even practicing numbing techniques on himself early in his training, because comfort during treatment should never be guessed.\n\n\n### Sedation\n\n\nWhen anxiety or longer treatment needs more support, sedation can help make care feel calmer, safer, and more manageable.\n\n\n### We Believe the Right Technology Produces Better Outcomes\n\n\nTechnology in dentistry is only useful when it improves what the clinician can see, plan, or deliver. We invest in equipment that meets that standard and nothing else.\n\nOur 3D cone beam imaging lets us see bone structure, nerve pathways, and sinus anatomy in three dimensions before we plan any procedure. Our intraoral scanner captures a digital model of your teeth in minutes without the discomfort of traditional impressions. Our digital planning software lets us design your restoration before we prepare a single tooth. Our surgical guides, printed directly from scan data, help us place implants exactly where they were planned.\n\nMore About Our Technology\n\n\n## We Believe the Details Matter Most\n\n\nThe gap between a good result and a great one is almost always in the details. The shade of a crown matched against natural light, not just a shade guide held up in a bright operatory. The contact between teeth that feels right on both sides, not just in one spot. The margin of a restoration that fits so precisely there is nowhere for bacteria to settle.\n\n\n## See what our patients have to say.\n\n\nWe Believe Trust Comes From What Patients Experience, Not What We Say About Ourselves\n\nSTORIES OF THE LIVES WE’VE TOUCHED\n\n\n### We Believe Treating the Cause Matters More Than Treating the Symptom\n\n\nA lot of dentistry is reactive. Something hurts, something breaks, something falls out. A fix gets applied. Time passes. Something else happens. That cycle is expensive and exhausting, and it rarely moves your oral health in a better direction.\n\nWe approach every new patient with a full diagnostic review, not just a look at what is bothering them today. We want to understand the condition of every tooth, the health of the bone and tissue, how the bite is functioning, and what the risk factors are for future problems. That picture allows us to make recommendations that actually reduce your dental burden over time rather than adding to it appointment by appointment.\n\nYou see the same doctor every time, so your care does not feel rushed, random, or passed around.\n\nYou understand the plan before we begin, including what we see, what matters, and what each step is meant to solve.\n\nOur recommendations are guided by evidence, experience, and judgment. Everything you need, nothing you don’t.\n\nWe handle complex care with confidence, and partner with trusted specialists when that is the better path.\n\n\n### Reimagine your dental experience\n\n\n\n### address\n\n\n9027 Silverbrook Rd Ste. F\n\nFairfax Station, VA 22039\n\n\n### Contact\n\n\n\n### Hours\n\n\nMon-Tue: 8am-5pm\n\nWed-Thu: 8am-4pm\n\nFri: 8am-1pm\n\n\n### Connect\n\n\nServing Fairfax Station and the Greater Northern Virginia Area\n\nCopyright © TEXT-YEAR Livewell Dental\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCookie Policy\n\nHIPAA Disclosure\n\nConsent Preferences",
